ription><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwSkFQQU4lMjBXaGF0JTIwaXMlMjBhbiUyMGludmVzdG1lbnQlMjB0cnVzdC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" alt=\"Canaan, Tether deepen partnership on immersion-cooled mining systems\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Canaan secures a new Tether order for modular mining hardware as the stablecoin issuer expands into integrated, data center-style Bitcoin infrastructure.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Sam Bourgi</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwSkFQQU4lMjBXaGF0JTIwaXMlMjBhbiUyMGludmVzdG1lbnQlMjB0cnVzdC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwSkFQQU4lMjBXaGF0JTIwaXMlMjBhbiUyMGludmVzdG1lbnQlMjB0cnVzdC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin price hits one-week low as $100 oil sparks fresh Asia crisis fears</title>\n      <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 16:07:44 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 16:07:44 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-price-hits-one-week-low-as-100-oil-sparks-fresh-asia-crisis-fears</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-price-hits-one-week-low-as-100-oil-sparks-fresh-asia-crisis-fears?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlLzMyNTIzNC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin price hits one-week low as $100 oil sparks fresh Asia crisis fears\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin price downside returned to send BTC to one-week lows thanks to renewed concerns over global oil supplies focused on the Strait of Hormuz blockade.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by William Suberg</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlLzMyNTIzNC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlLzMyNTIzNC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>BitMart x EAT Trade-to-Feed competition to pay out $4.4m USDT to traders in May 2026</title>\n      <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 15:45:04 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 15:45:04 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/bitmart-x-eat-trade-to-feed-competition-to-pay-out-44m-usdt-to-traders-in-may-2026</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/bitmart-x-eat-trade-to-feed-competition-to-pay-out-44m-usdt-to-traders-in-may-2026?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlLzI2MDIyMDI1MS5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" alt=\"BitMart x EAT Trade-to-Feed competition to pay out $4.4m USDT to traders in May 2026\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The 30-day Trade-to-Feed competition marks BitMart's 8th anniversary and the exchange's strategic listing of EAT, the first cause coin.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Advertorial</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlLzI2MDIyMDI1MS5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlLzI2MDIyMDI1MS5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Press Releases</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin price drops below $76K as onchain data sends mixed signals</title>\n      <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 15:37:33 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 15:37:33 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-price-drops-to-76k-as-onchain-data-sends-mixed-signals</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-price-drops-to-76k-as-onchain-data-sends-mixed-signals?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwQ3J5cHRvJTIwVHJhZGluZyUyMEJhc2ljcyUyMC0lMjBBJTIwYmVnaW5uZXIncyUyMGd1aWRlJTIwdG8lMjBjcnlwdG9jdXJyZW5jeSUyME9yZGVyJTIwdHlwZXMxLTEuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin price drops below $76K as onchain data sends mixed signals\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin failed to break $80,000 resistance amid weak onchain fundamentals, but risin