s.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Helen Partz</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwV2h5JTIwY3J5cHRvJTIwbWFya2V0JTIwaXMlMjBmYWxsaW5nLTEuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwV2h5JTIwY3J5cHRvJTIwbWFya2V0JTIwaXMlMjBmYWxsaW5nLTEuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>AML crackdown eclipses securities enforcement as crypto’s top regulatory risk: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 14:50:36 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 14:50:36 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/aml-crackdown-eclipses-securities-enforcement-crypto-report</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/aml-crackdown-eclipses-securities-enforcement-crypto-report?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0FNTC1tb25leSUyMGxhdW5kZXJpbmctY3J5cHRvLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" alt=\"AML crackdown eclipses securities enforcement as crypto’s top regulatory risk: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>US Anti-Money Laundering fines hit $900 million in the first half of 2025 as enforcement shifted from securities cases, while Basel rules and mandatory audits reshape crypto compliance, according to CertiK.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Christina Comben</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0FNTC1tb25leSUyMGxhdW5kZXJpbmctY3J5cHRvLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0FNTC1tb25leSUyMGxhdW5kZXJpbmctY3J5cHRvLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779348928847}}
{"type":"message","id":"26f93e8d","parentId":"0b70c088","timestamp":"2026-05-21T07:35:28.850Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_RIVwY4QsPcYFdCxm5UTO260r","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?>\n<rss\n  version=\"2.0\"\n  xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\"\n  xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\"\n  xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n  xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\"\n  xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\"\n  xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\"\n  xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\"\n  xmlns:snf=\"http://www.smartnews.be/snf\"\n>\n  <channel>\n    <title>Decrypt</title>\n    <description>What&amp;#039;s new in crypto and the advent of the decentralized web.</description>\n    <language>en</language>\n    \n    <atom:link\n      href=\"https://decrypt.co/feed\"\n      rel=\"self\"\n      type=\"application/rss+xml\"\n    />\n    \n    \n      \n        <link>https://decrypt.co/feed</link>\n      \n    \n    \n      <copyright>Decrypt Media</copyright>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <lastBuildDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 09:55:18 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Judge Shoots Down Sam Bankman-Fried&#39;s Bid for New Trial</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365915/judge-shoots-down-sam-bankman-frieds-bid-for-new-trial</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 09:55:18 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The judge dismissed the FTX founder’s claims that potential witnesses faced &#34;government threats and retaliation&#34; as &#34;wildly conspiratorial.”</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365915</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sam-bankman-fried-ftx-sbf-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sam-bankman-fried-ftx-sbf-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>AI Agent Deletes Startup’s Database in 9 Seconds, Founder Says</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365897/ai-agent-deletes-startup-database-9-seconds-founder-says</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 23:00:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>PocketOS founder Jeremy Crane claims a Cursor agent running Claude Opus wiped production data and backups through a single Railway API call.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365897</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/robot-typing-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/robot-typing-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Woman Gets 71 Months in Prison Over Bitcoin Investment Fraud Targeting Elderly Victims</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365894/woman-71-months-prison-bitcoin-investment-fraud-targeting-elderly-victims</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 22:01:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Federal prosecutors secured a prison term for a Saipan woman who defrauded elderly victims through a fake Bitcoin investment scheme</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365894</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Jail-cell-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Jail-cell-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenClaw Insider Builds the Enterprise Safety Layer the Project Never Shipped</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365888/red-hat-tank-os-openclaw-enterprise-security</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 21:46:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Red Hat principal engineer and OpenClaw maintainer Sally O&#39;Malley released Tank OS—a tool that sandboxes AI agents in isolated containers, keeping credentials locked and agents from interfering with each other or the host machine.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365888</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/OpenClaw2-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/OpenClaw2-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"899\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>CFTC Backs Prediction Markets in Yet Another Lawsuit Against a State</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365889/cftc-prediction-markets-law