{"type":"message","id":"0480b95e","parentId":"380eadf8","timestamp":"2026-05-21T07:35:35.458Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_KCf8Zt22qQiFxZwFBNwl3rlX","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"132:  <title>Woman Gets 71 Months in Prison Over Bitcoin Investment Fraud Targeting Elderly Victims</title>\n136:    <description>Federal prosecutors secured a prison term for a Saipan woman who defrauded elderly victims through a fake Bitcoin investment scheme</description>\n474:  <title>IREN Price Target Cut as Bernstein Sees Firm Dumping Bitcoin Mining for AI</title>\n478:    <description>Bernstein analysts see IREN’s AI cloud prospects growing substantially in the coming years—and its Bitcoin business disappearing entirely.</description>\n518:  <title>Aave, Compound Unveil Technical Plan to Address Fallout From $290M Kelp DAO Hack</title>\n566:  <title>Stablecoin Giant Tether Reveals Plans for Modular Bitcoin Mining Hardware</title>\n570:    <description>Leading stablecoin issuer Tether has teamed with Canaan and ACME Swisstech to develop customizable, upgradable Bitcoin mining rigs.</description>\n742:  <title>White House Crypto Adviser Hints at ‘Breakthrough’ Bitcoin Reserve Move</title>\n746:    <description>A &#34;big announcement&#34; on the U.S. Bitcoin strategic reserve could drop soon, but Treasury and a stalled Senate bill continue to set limits.</description>\n786:  <title>Bitcoin&#39;s Next Move Hinges on $82K CME Gap as Earnings, FOMC Loom</title>\n790:    <description>Big Tech earnings and the FOMC are challenging investor risk appetite, with $82K as a make-or-break level for Bitcoin’s recovery rally.</description>\n834:    <description>Fidelity says crypto may finally be finding its floor, while the White House is teasing a major strategic Bitcoin reserve update.</description>\n916:  <title>Jack Dorsey&#39;s Block Discloses $2.2B Bitcoin Holdings in Q1 Proof-of-Reserves Report</title>\n920:    <description>The fintech company&#39;s third-party audited disclosure shows $1.5 billion in customer Bitcoin and $692 million in corporate treasury holdings.</description>\n1002:  <title>Aave-Led &#39;DeFi United&#39; Relief Effort Raises $300 Million to Cover Kelp DAO Exploit Losses</title>\n1006:    <description>The Aave-led relief effort has gained widespread support, securing enough commitments to replenish the swiped funds.</description>\n1090:  <title>Bitcoin Developer Plans to &#39;Reassign&#39; Coins Linked to Satoshi Nakamoto in Hard Fork</title>\n1094:    <description>Paul Sztorc’s proposed eCash fork would give investors coins cloned from wallets believed to belong to Bitcoin creator Satoshi Nakamoto.</description>\n1302:  <title>Publicly Traded Strive Buys $60 Million in Bitcoin, Plans BTC Business Summit</title>\n1306:    <description>Strive Inc. purchased 789 more Bitcoin while its subsidiary prepares to educate business leaders on corporate crypto adoption.</description>\n1314:    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-25-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n1329:      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-25-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":80,"aggregated":"132:  <title>Woman Gets 71 Months in Prison Over Bitcoin Investment Fraud Targeting Elderly Victims</title>\n136:    <description>Federal prosecutors secured a prison term for a Saipan woman who defrauded elderly victims through a fake Bitcoin investment scheme</description>\n474:  <title>IREN Price Target Cut as Bernstein Sees Firm Dumping Bitcoin Mining for AI</title>\n478:    <description>Bernstein analysts see IREN’s AI cloud prospects growing substantially in the coming years—and its Bitcoin business disappearing entirely.</description>\n518:  <title>Aave, Compound Unveil Technical Plan to Address Fallout From $290M Kelp DAO Hack</title>\n566:  <title>Stablecoin Giant Tether Reveals Plans for Modular Bitcoin Mining Hardware</title>\n570:    <description>Leading stablecoin issuer Tether has teamed with Canaan and ACME Swisstech to develop customizable, upgradable Bitcoin mining rigs.</description>\n742:  <title>White House Crypto Adviser Hints at ‘Breakthrough’ Bitcoin Reserve Move</title>\n746:    <description>A &#34;big announcement&#34; on the U.S. Bitcoin strategic reserve could drop soon, but Treasury and a stalled Senate bill continue to set limits.</description>\n786:  <title>Bitcoin&#39;s Next Move Hinges on $82K CME Gap as Earnings, FOMC Loom</title>\n790:    <description>Big Tech earnings and the FOMC are challenging investor risk appetite, with $82K as a make-or-break level for Bitcoin’s recovery rally.</description>\n834:    <description>Fidelity says crypto may finally be finding its floor, while the White House is teasing a major strategic Bitcoin reserve update.</description>\n916:  <title>Jack Dorsey&#39;s Block Discloses $2.2B Bitcoin Holdings in Q1 Proof-of-Reserves Report</title>\n920:    <description>The fintech company&#39;s third-party audited disclosure shows $1.5 billion in customer Bitcoin and $692 million in corporate treasury holdings.</description>\n1002:  <title>Aave-Led &#39;DeFi United&#39; Relief Effort Raises $300 Million to Cover Kelp DAO Exploit Losses</title>\n1006:    <description>The Aave-led relief effort has gained widespread support, securing enough commitments to replenish the swiped funds.</description>\n1090:  <title>Bitcoin Developer Plans to &#39;Reassign&#39; Coins Linked to Satoshi Nakamoto in Hard Fork</title>\n1094:    <description>Paul Sztorc’s proposed eCash fork would give investors coins cloned from wallets believed to belong to Bitcoin creator Satoshi Nakamoto.</description>\n1302:  <title>Publicly Traded Strive Buys $60 Million in Bitcoin, Plans BTC Business Summit</title>\n1306: