{"type":"message","id":"1f8bcc9b","parentId":"0fe89485","timestamp":"2026-05-21T07:36:20.592Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_x9BvXaTkyqkskOgYwbOoUfcl","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/is-ethereum-safe-above-2k-traders-are-watching-these-eth-price-levels</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/is-ethereum-safe-above-2k-traders-are-watching-these-eth-price-levels?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0VUSCUyMGNvdmVyJTIwQXByaWwlMjAyOC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" alt=\"Is Ethereum safe above $2K? Traders are watching these ETH price levels\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Ethereum market participants saw the 100-day SMA at $2,200 as particularly important for bulls to hold to avoid a deeper correction.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Nancy Lubale</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0VUSCUyMGNvdmVyJTIwQXByaWwlMjAyOC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0VUSCUyMGNvdmVyJTIwQXByaWwlMjAyOC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>OKX lets institutions use BlackRock’s BUIDL fund as trading collateral</title>\n      <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 11:03:28 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 11:03:28 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/okx-adds-blackrocks-tokenized-treasury-fund-standard-chartered</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/okx-adds-blackrocks-tokenized-treasury-fund-standard-chartered?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLXNCVUlETCUyQy1CbGFja1JvY2slRTIlODAlOTlzLXRva2VuaXplZC10cmVhc3VyeS1mdW5kLTEuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" alt=\"OKX lets institutions use BlackRock’s BUIDL fund as trading collateral\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>OKX integrates BlackRock’s tokenized Treasury fund into Standard Chartered custody, allowing institutions to use it as regulated trading collateral.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Christina Comben</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLXNCVUlETCUyQy1CbGFja1JvY2slRTIlODAlOTlzLXRva2VuaXplZC10cmVhc3VyeS1mdW5kLTEuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLXNCVUlETCUyQy1CbGFja1JvY2slRTIlODAlOTlzLXRva2VuaXplZC10cmVhc3VyeS1mdW5kLTEuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Changelly and Tonkeeper enable cross-chain deposits to TON across 13 networks</title>\n      <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 10:26:33 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 10:26:33 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/changelly-and-tonkeeper-enable-cross-chain-deposits-to-ton-across-13-networks</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/changelly-and-tonkeeper-enable-cross-chain-deposits-to-ton-across-13-networks?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlLzI2MDIyMDI1LTEuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" alt=\"Changelly and Tonkeeper enable cross-chain deposits to TON across 13 networks\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Changelly and Tonkeeper have teamed up to make cross-chain deposits into TON a seamless, in-wallet experience.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Advertorial</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlLzI2MDIyMDI1LTEuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlLzI2MDIyMDI1LTEuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Press Releases</category>\n    </item>\n  </channel>\n</rss>"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":95,"aggregated":"<guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/is-ethereum-safe-above-2k-traders-are-watching-these-eth-price-levels</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/is-ethereum-safe-above-2k-traders-are-watching-these-eth-price-levels?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/